rust code whose apparent completeness masks major quality problems\n- 86-100: Overwhelming — the branch is almost entirely disposable, misleading, or hazardous agent-like output\n\nReserve scores below 10 for unusually disciplined diffs. Any unambiguous slop should prevent a near-zero score; multiple independent patterns should normally score at least 31. The rationale must cite the strongest concrete evidence and must not use vague praise or generic criticism.\n\nAfter your analysis, output ONLY this JSON object as the very last line of your response:\n\n{\"value\": <number 0-100>, \"rationale\": \"<1-2 sentence evidence-based explanation>\"}"
